# BUG-10 reproduction: V-shaped knife (use with bug09_clay.obj, the unit cube).
# Surface z = max(-2x, 2x); the crease lies along the bottom-left edge of the
# cube, so some intersection points are existing cube vertices.  Normals point
# up (+z).  On the top face the region above the knife is half of the face.

v  0 -6  0
v  0  6  0
v -6  0 12
v  6  0 12

f 1 2 3
f 1 4 2
